# Premium Tools

Premium Tools is a Windows desktop dashboard for gaming optimization focused on smooth FiveM gameplay. The project includes a dark cyberpunk interface inspired by the reference image and locks access behind the activation key: `godego`.

## Features

- Dark premium dashboard UI inspired by the reference image
- Real-time CPU / RAM / GPU display
- Quick access optimization actions
- Activation window with key validation
- Performance utility helpers for cleanup and optimization

## Requirements

- Windows 10/11
- .NET 8 SDK
- Visual Studio 2022 or Windows desktop build tools

## Build

```bash
dotnet build PremiumTools/PremiumTools.csproj -c Release
```

## Run

```bash
dotnet run --project PremiumTools/PremiumTools.csproj
```

## Activation key

`godego`

This repository contains the build-ready desktop project and the UI shell for the premium gaming optimization tool.
